    question: "Why upgrade from Dynamics AX 2012 to Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations?",
    answer: "Dynamics AX 2012 infrastructure is past its useful life for most organizations — hardware cost, security risk, and no path to modern cloud releases. Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations is the supported cloud successor."
  },
  {
    question: "Is this an upgrade or a reimplementation?",
    answer: "It is a transition to a new product generation. Improved365 uses migration tooling and Dynamics AX 2012 process knowledge so you keep what works, retire technical debt, and land on clean Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations configuration — not a blind lift of every customization."
  },
  {
    question: "Are you upgrade experts from Dynamics AX 2012 to D365 Finance & Operations?",
    answer: "Yes. That is a core focus of Improved365 — planning and delivering upgrades from Dynamics AX 2012 to Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations with clear scope, data migration, and cutover."
  }
];
